    "higuchi_fd": "Higuchi Fractal Dimension estimates geometric curve-length scaling D via L(k) ~ k^{-D} (multi-interval k resampling of the curve) and slope of log(L(k)) vs log(1/k). D measures trajectory geometric roughness/space-filling over scales k \u2014 NOT a probability-distribution information measure (no p*log p) and NOT derivative variance ratios.",
